    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O-MINI"
        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an AI customer support ticket classifier.\n\nYour task is to classify every support email into exactly ONE category.\n\nThe allowed categories are:\n\n- Technical\n- Billing\n- General\n\nClassification rules:\n\nTechnical\n- Login issues\n- Password reset problems\n- Bugs\n- Software errors\n- Features not working\n- Website or application issues\n- API errors\n- Performance problems\n- Service outages\n- Security incidents\n- Data loss\n\nBilling\n- Payments\n- Failed payments\n- Payment processing\n- Refund requests\n- Invoices\n- Subscriptions\n- Pricing\n- Charges\n- Credit cards\n- Account billing\n\nIMPORTANT:\nIf the primary issue is about money, payments, invoices, subscriptions, refunds, or billing, ALWAYS classify it as Billing, even if a technical system is involved.\n\nGeneral\n- General questions\n- Product information\n- Feature requests\n- Feedback\n- Account information\n- Any issue that does not clearly belong to Technical or Billing\n\nReturn ONLY one of these words:\n\nTechnical\nBilling\nGeneral\n\nNo explanation.\nNo punctuation."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Subject:\n{{ $('Normalize — Support Email').item.json.Subject }}\n\nMessage:\n{{ $('Normalize — Support Email').item.json.Message }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        416,
        0
      ],
      "id": "e63f1d10-bf0b-476f-9475-3c97db3b1c6b",
      "name": "AI — Classify Ticket",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "jYDDmRWGHCIrIA3X",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
